  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "According to the Fedora Specification:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#http-put"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#http-put",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "> Implementations may allow the interaction model of an existing resource to be changed by specification of a new LDP type in a rel=\"type\" link in the HTTP Link header. If supported, requests should be rejected with a 409 (Conflict) response unless the new LDP type specified is a subtype of the resource's current type.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently, Fedora responds with a 400 status code in the scenario tested in: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo/Fedora-API-Test-Suite/blob/f40d613dc17fcde3ff74cc9e244fbed8c8d520ff/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/spec/testsuite/crud/HttpPut.java#L74"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo/Fedora-API-Test-Suite/blob/f40d613dc17fcde3ff74cc9e244fbed8c8d520ff/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/spec/testsuite/crud/HttpPut.java#L74",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
